Name:           billing
Path:           services/billing
Environment:    abc12345.apps.dynatrace.com
File:           .dtctl-repo-scope.yaml
Services:       SERVICE-0123456789ABCDEF
Filters:
  fetch logs   not scoped: entry "billing" binds nothing fetch logs is filtered by (dt.entity.process_group, service.name, or k8s.namespace.name with k8s.workload.name)
  fetch spans  | filter (in(dt.entity.service, array("SERVICE-0123456789ABCDEF")))
Live Debugger filters:
  none: entry "billing" binds only service ids, which Live Debugger does not honour as a workspace label; bind --namespace/--workload or --process-group
Other entries:  checkout, ledger
